  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **If I Had The World To Give** (1 review): Reviewer says this song alone justifies the price of admission [2]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Queen Jane Approximately**: back after 75 archived shows (721 days); rare: 4 archived performances [3]\n- **If I Had The World To Give**: rare: 9 archived performances [3]\n- **Little Red Rooster**: rare: 9 archived performances [3]\n- **SmokeStack Lightining**: back after 72 archived shows (716 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **Werewolves Of London**: rare: 13 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **DeaCo2018-06-19.DarienLakeDarienCenterNY** (recommended): audience recording; 19 songs; 183 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Reviewer considers this the tour's sleeper show, an underrated night compared with others on the run [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **DeaCo2018-06-19.DarienLakeDarienCenterNY**: taped by JT/NY; transferred by JT/NY; source: Aud > Nak 700's W CP701's > GAKable's > Sound Devices 722 @ 24/96 [1]. Also: Transfer path: CF 24/96, tracked and edited in Sound Forge Pro 10.0, then converted to FLAC with Traders Little Helper [1]",
